# Privacy Policy 
This privacy policy applies to the **Attention Spawner** app for mobile devices, together with any related services operated by **Attention Spawner Team** (collectively, the "Application or Service Provider "). 

## Information Collection and Use 
The Application collects information when you download and use it. This information may include:
- Your device's Internet Protocol (IP) address
- Operating system version and device model
- Time spent on the Application and usage interaction metrics

### Sensitive Permissions & On-Device Data Processing
To fulfill its core functionality as an app blocker and attention manager, the Application requests specific Android permissions:
- **Installed Applications (`QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES`)**: Used strictly to allow you to select which apps you wish to block or monitor.

- **App Usage Stats (`PACKAGE_USAGE_STATS`)**: Used solely to detect when a blocked application is launched in the foreground.
- **Display Over Apps (`SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW`)**: Used to display the blocking overlay when a restricted app is opened.

> **Note on Data Privacy**: All app usage monitoring, app list scanning, and blocking rules are executed **locally on your device**. The Service Provider does not transmit, sell, or store your installed app list or app usage activity on external servers.

